BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Japanese Friendship Bracelet Making for Kids!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260805T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260805T150000
UID:6a2ad33cc7d3cd58005f9a15@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we make kumihimo friendship bracelets! Kumihimo tra
 nslates literally to "gathered threads" and is a traditional Japanese brai
