BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Raíces — Classical & Latin American Guitar
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260926T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260926T150000
UID:6a4c13ab9302a0b2287ae36a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Toronto-based guitarist Karla García invites audiences on a m
 usical journey from the elegance of the Baroque era to the rich musical tr
 aditions of Latin America. Featuring works by Bach\, Dilermando Reis\, Ví
 ctor Jara\, Luiz Bonfá\, and Chilean composers Antonio Restucci\, alongsi
 de original compositions from her upcoming debut album\, this concert cele
 brates the timeless voice of the classical guitar—intimate\, soulful\, a
 nd deeply human.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Main Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a4c13ab9302a0b2287ae36a
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
